Value TIMOS_VERSION (\S+)
Value ARCHITECTURE (\S+)
Value PRODUCT_NAME (.+?)
Value COPYRIGHT (.+)
Value LICENSE_STATEMENT (.+)
Value BUILD_DATE_TIME (.+? \d{4})
Value BUILD_BUILDER (\S+)
Value BUILD_PATH (.+)

Start
  ^\s*A:admin@sr-2se-1-a# show version\s*$$
  ^\s*${TIMOS_VERSION}\s*${ARCHITECTURE}\s*${PRODUCT_NAME}\s*${COPYRIGHT}\s*$$
  ^\s*${LICENSE_STATEMENT}\s*$$
  ^\s*Built on\s*${BUILD_DATE_TIME}\s*by\s*${BUILD_BUILDER}\s*in\s*${BUILD_PATH}\s*$$
  
